44249-1	Patient Health Questionnaire (PHQ-9)	{"prompt":"Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by any of the following problems?","items":[{"code":"44250-9","text":"Little interest or pleasure in doing things in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44255-8","text":"Feeling down, depressed, or hopeless in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44259-0","text":"Trouble falling or staying asleep, or sleeping too much in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44254-1","text":"Feeling tired or having little energy in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44251-7","text":"Poor appetite or overeating in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44258-2","text":"Feeling bad about yourself - or that you are a failure or have let yourself or your family down in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44252-5","text":"Trouble concentrating on things, such as reading the newspaper or watching television in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44253-3","text":"Moving or speaking so slowly that other people could have noticed. Or the opposite - being so fidgety or restless that you have been moving around a lot more than usual in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"44260-8","text":"Thoughts that you would be better off dead, or of hurting yourself in some way in last 2 weeks"}],"answers":[{"code":"LA6568-5","text":"Not at all","score":0},{"code":"LA6569-3","text":"Several days","score":1},{"code":"LA6570-1","text":"More than half the days","score":2},{"code":"LA6571-9","text":"Nearly every day","score":3}],"total":"44261-6","bands":[{"from":0,"to":4,"band":"Minimal"},{"from":5,"to":9,"band":"Mild"},{"from":10,"to":14,"band":"Moderate"},{"from":15,"to":19,"band":"Moderately severe"},{"from":20,"to":27,"band":"Severe"}]}	Copyright © Pfizer Inc. All rights reserved. Developed by Drs. Robert L. Spitzer, Janet B.W. Williams, Kurt Kroenke and colleagues, with an educational grant from Pfizer Inc. No permission required to reproduce, translate, display or distribute.
69737-5	Generalized Anxiety Disorder scale (GAD-7)	{"prompt":"Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by any of the following problems?","items":[{"code":"69725-0","text":"Feeling nervous, anxious or on edge in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"68509-9","text":"Not able to stop or control worrying in the last 2 weeks"},{"code":"69733-4","text":"Worrying too much about different things in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"69734-2","text":"Trouble relaxing in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"69735-9","text":"Being so restless that it is hard to sit still in last 2 weeks"},{"code":"69689-8","text":"Becoming easily annoyed or irritable in last 4 weeks"},{"code":"69736-7","text":"Feeling afraid as if something awful might happen in last 2 weeks"}],"answers":[{"code":"LA6568-5","text":"Not at all","score":0},{"code":"LA6569-3","text":"Several days","score":1},{"code":"LA6570-1","text":"More than half the days","score":2},{"code":"LA6571-9","text":"Nearly every day","score":3}],"total":"70274-6","bands":[{"from":0,"to":4,"band":"Minimal"},{"from":5,"to":9,"band":"Mild"},{"from":10,"to":14,"band":"Moderate"},{"from":15,"to":21,"band":"Severe"}]}	Copyright © Pfizer Inc. All rights reserved. Developed by Drs. Robert L. Spitzer, Janet B.W. Williams, Kurt Kroenke and colleagues, with an educational grant from Pfizer Inc. No permission required to reproduce, translate, display or distribute.
